# A land the controller does not reveal (Decline) may be put into the graveyard instead (Accept) - no discard, no mill.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Traveling Botanist
Island x5
Swamp
Forest
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Traveling Botanist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Traveling Botanist > Bot2)
Bot1.Decline
Bot1.Accept

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest; Black Lotus
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
